<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>一翦梅</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Fei Yu-ching</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">天之大</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5Vnx5i9VJSZ6ayfK6jncf8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.520" end="00:43.360">真情像草原广阔</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.360" end="00:50.100">层层风雨不能阻隔</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.100" end="00:57.270">总有云开日出时候</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.270" end="01:03.730">万丈阳光照耀你我</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.730" end="01:10.360">真情像梅花开过</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.360" end="01:17.160">冷冷冰雪不能掩没</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.160" end="01:24.310">就在最冷枝头绽放</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.310" end="01:31.090">看见春天走向你我</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.090" end="01:37.830">雪花飘飘 北风萧萧</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.830" end="01:44.720">天地 一片 苍茫</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.720" end="01:51.470">一翦寒梅 傲立雪中</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.470" end="01:58.220">只为 伊人 飘香</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.220" end="02:04.930">爱我所爱 无怨无悔</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.930" end="02:12.930">此情 长留 心间</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.100" end="02:28.100" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.440" end="02:52.330">雪花飘飘 北风萧萧</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.330" end="02:59.190">天地 一片 苍茫</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.190" end="03:05.890">一翦寒梅 傲立雪中</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.890" end="03:12.790">只为 伊人 飘香</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.790" end="03:19.360">爱我所爱 无怨无悔</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.360" end="03:27.360">此情 长留 心间</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.760" end="03:36.760" /></div></body></tt>